{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411190","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1341119001:0":{"text":"何度来ても、この景色には圧倒されるわね。広大な花畑、太古の遺跡、清らかに流れる川、遠くに連なる雪山……","source_cn":"无论来这里多少次，我都还是会被这样的美景所震撼。大片的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9547E36FB406C7DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1341119002:0":{"text":"そして、夕日に照らされた、戦士たちの血と犠牲の証でもある剣塚……本当に、綺麗だわ。","source_cn":"还有夕阳下的剑冢，那是战士们用鲜血和牺牲换来的纪念碑。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63F5C2AF2B45DE5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1341119003:0":{"text":"ごめんなさい、また感傷に浸ってしまったわ。そう言えば、エレナ王女の葬儀の手伝いをするって聞いたけど……","source_cn":"抱歉，我又心生感慨了。我听说你们会帮忙筹备亚莲娜公主的葬礼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1CB90CD41CF07B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1341119003":{"text":"ごめんなさい、また感傷に浸ってしまったわ。そう言えば、エレナ王女の葬儀の手伝いをするって聞いたけど……","source_cn":"抱歉，我又心生感慨了。我听说你们会帮忙筹备亚莲娜公主的葬礼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1CB90CD41CF07B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1341119004:1":{"text":"そうしたいけど、ロドリゴたちはきっと、私の顔なんて見たくないでしょう。","source_cn":"我也想帮忙，但罗德里戈他们恐怕不会很乐意见到我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CEA5980AEF28488","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_